<!--
VERIFICATION RECEIPT TEMPLATE v1.0

Fields:
- claim: Exact claim text, frozen before any network call
- timestamp_utc: ISO 8601 UTC when verification started
- read_paths: Array of exactly 2 independent read results
  Each path has:
  - method: "http" | "dns" | "api" | "ledger"
  - url/query: Target for this path
  - status: HTTP status or 200 for DNS success
  - body_hash/record_hash: SHA256 of response body or DNS records
  - error: Empty on success, error message on failure
- verdict: "verified" (both paths agree) | "disputed" (paths disagree) | "unverifiable" (<2 paths succeeded)
- receipt_id: vr-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXX (date + 6 hex chars)
- verifier: Identity and version of verifier

INVARIANTS:
1. Claim is frozen before ANY read path executes
2. Exactly 2 read paths, independent infrastructure
3. Raw responses hashed, not stored in full (privacy)
4. Verdict derived ONLY from path agreement
5. Receipt ID deterministic from claim + timestamp
6. Verifier identity recorded for accountability
-->